WEBVTT

00:00:03.335 --> 00:00:06.670
Huh. Official letter. Says the date stands.

00:00:10.005 --> 00:00:13.340
This one's delayed. But you still have to prove you're ready.

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:16.675
Deploy more agents. One squad per regulator.

00:00:23.345 --> 00:00:26.680
All of it goes in here. The problem was never the volume, it's what leaves the boat.

00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:30.015
Oh. It floats. Same paperwork, but it floats.

